Hi @ihor-sviziev @hostep, thanks for highlighting this issue. I wonder if this is still reproducible on 2.4-develop, as far as I can see the `getTransport()` method is always resetting its values since 2019.

```
    public function getTransport()
    {
        try {
            $this->prepareMessage();
            $mailTransport = $this->mailTransportFactory->create(['message' => clone $this->message]);
        } finally {
            $this->reset();
        }

        return $mailTransport;
    }
```

@ryanpalmerweb were you able to reproduce this issue on the latest release 2.4.2? Thanks!
